      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Acc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" data-account-id=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" accountid=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Yinlin Chen</a>, thank you for taking the initiative to work this ticket. I should have been more clear in the title and description.<br/>\nInstead of masking the issue in the HTML UI .vsl files, the ideal solution would be to use the version labels instead of the internal UUIDs deeper in the code.<br/>\nFor example, a GET request following the steps detailed in the description above returns RDF with the version UUID included &#8211; we do not want this.<br/>\nI suspect the full solution will share similarities with:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/6b291ea1cf62712829d3bf7d21fd16ce47675f8e\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/6b291ea1cf62712829d3bf7d21fd16ce47675f8e</a></p>\n\n<p>Thoughts, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" data-account-id=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" accountid=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Michael Durbin</a>?</p>",
