  "description": "<p>This task is a follow-on to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1703\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1703</a></p>\n\n<p>When versioning containers, the UUID of the version shows up in the HTML UI display. To reproduce:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Create a container<br/>\ncurl -i -XPUT localhost:8080/rest/book</li>\n\t<li>Version the container<br/>\ncurl -i -XPOST -H\"slug: v0\" localhost:8080/rest/book/fcr:versions</li>\n\t<li>View the version in the HTML UI<br/>\n...boom, see UUID in breadcrumb and resource title</li>\n</ul>\n",
